{"segs": ["ZH_T19_0974A_001:0384b14_100_33", "ZH_T19_0974A_001:0384b14_100_34", "ZH_T19_0974A_001:0384b14_100_35"], "en": "42. *mudre mudre mahāmudre* (43) *tathāgatodbhūte* (44) *gati-pariśuddhe* (45) *viṣabhuṭa-viśuddhe* (46).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T15:40:14Z"},
{"segs": ["ZH_T19_0974A_001:0384b14_100_36", "ZH_T19_0974A_001:0384b14_100_37", "ZH_T19_0974A_001:0384b14_100_38"], "en": "Oṃ hī hī (47) jaya jaya mahājaya (48) samāra samāra (49) saṃsāra saṃsāra (50) satvabuddha (51).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T15:40:14Z"},
